    "description": "<p>Vaelori produce specialised spores that assist decomposition, suppress harmful rot and support the health of cultivated fungal networks. They are therefore gardeners, healers and corpse-tenders in equal measure, occupations that Myrathi culture sees as closely related.<br>A Vaelori may spend the morning treating a sick child, the afternoon pruning diseased fungal growth and the evening preparing a body for planting. All three acts are understood as maintaining the health of the same living cycle. Their familiarity with decay can make outsiders uncomfortable, but Vaelori rarely see a contradiction between reverence for life and acceptance of decomposition. To them, one makes the other possible.</p>\n<p>You gain a +1 racial bonus to Medicine checks and gain Purify as a verdant innate spell with the Focus trait.</p>",
